            "role": "user",
            "content": "Given these aspects:\n# Two Key Aspects of Antibiotics\n\n1. **Selective Toxicity**\n   - Antibiotics target bacterial cells while minimizing harm to human cells\n   - They exploit differences between bacterial and human cell structures (e.g., targeting bacterial cell walls, which human cells lack)\n\n2. **Spectrum of Activity**\n   - Antibiotics vary in their range of effectiveness against different bacteria\n   - **Narrow-spectrum**: target specific types of bacteria (e.g., only Gram-positive)\n   - **Broad-spectrum**: effective against a wide range of bacterial species\nWrite one sentence connecting them."
          }
        ]
